  "decision": "stop",
  "rationale": "The feasible Pareto front is well-established and satisfies all constraints. The minimum area design (pipelined_m, 826 LUTs+FFs) meets the throughput constraint (97.8 MSPS >= 1) and the accuracy constraint (max_abs_err 0.000976 <= 0.000976562). The front covers the trade-off space effectively, with area ranging from 826 to 1716 and accuracy from 10 to 12.3 bits. Since this is the final round, we stop and select the design with minimum luts_plus_ffs (826) as per the selection rule."
